# After any feature or substantial change

Do the following without waiting for the user to ask:

## 1. Update technical docs + DEV_BLOG

Keep these in sync whenever you change code, schema, architecture, dependencies, navigation, or shipping status:

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| [`docs/TECHNICAL.md`](docs/TECHNICAL.md) | Tech truth: schema, folders, run commands, shipped vs stub |
| [`docs/DEV_BLOG.md`](docs/DEV_BLOG.md) | Chronological changelog (newest first): **what** + **why** in short bullets |
| [`docs/TODOS.md`](docs/TODOS.md) | Checklist status for major workstreams |

- Reflect what actually shipped (not aspirational PLAN items).
- Product vision / visual language stay in `docs/PLAN.md` and `docs/STYLE.md`.
- **DEV_BLOG:** after each substantial chunk, add a dated entry at the **top** (RU or RU+EN brief). Do not skip when only “small” UI polish if it changes user-visible behavior.

